// EVODETC - determinant of the square workspace (N x N) by elimination -> P/Q
// det = (-1)^swaps x product of the REF pivots.  Destroys the workspace.
// Preserves T Z.  Clobbers: A-F I-L O-S X Y G H U θ
0→L:1→F:N→E:prgmEVOROW
If U<N:Then
0→P:1→Q
Else
θ→P:1→Q
For(K,1,N)
[I](K,K)→R:[J](K,K)→S:3→O:prgmEVOFRAC
End
End
